cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SameSim in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SameSim: bit-reproducible discrete-event simulation of message-passing agents"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic discrete-event simulator for message-passing agents on
  dynamic networks (gossip, consensus, epidemics, queues, opinion dynamics).
  The same seed gives the same run, bit for bit, on Linux, macOS and Windows
  and on Python 3.10-3.13.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Agnivesh
    family-names: Kumar
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ImCYMBIOT/samesim"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/samesim/"
keywords:
  - discrete-event simulation
  - distributed algorithms
  - gossip protocols
  - agent-based modeling
  - reproducibility
